               <div class="faq-q-and-a__accordion-content-wrapper">
                  <div itemprop="text"><p>An electric toothbrush with flosser – such as the Dyson CameraJet™ toothbrush – jets liquid between teeth as you brush, removing plaque in areas brushing alone can’t reach.</p>
